{"id":"wb-7-1187","name":"碧霞宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"碧霞宫 (浚县)","text":"碧霞宫即“碧霞元君行宫”，俗称“圣母庙”、“奶奶庙”、“老奶大殿”，位于中华人民共和国河南省浚县城内浮丘山顶，为供奉道教女神碧霞元君的宫观。碧霞宫于明嘉靖二十一年（1542年）由时任知县蒋虹泉建于浮丘山顶，明、清、民国期间几经扩建，共有殿宇87间。1963年6月20日，碧霞宫随同在浮丘山上的千佛寺石窟被公布为第一批河南省文物保护单位，2013年3月被公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A2%A7%E9%9C%9E%E5%AE%AB_(%E6%B5%9A%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":85406878,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85406878","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d5c713578eb749194163b996.jpg","title":"20241201_Bixia_Gong_07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241201_Bixia_Gong_07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/20241201_Bixia_Gong_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​浚县碧霞宫","width":320,"height":213}}